  "description": "*\"How can it be this good?\"*\n\nIt's as if someone has messed with his head. One day, Yoon Sung-Hyun hears about a self-hypnosis app at work. Curious about the app that hypnotizes himself and helps him diet and improve his grades, he tries to download the app. However, surprisingly, the app is already installed on his phone, and when he runs the app, a shocking message pops up. \\[Content: Yoon Sung-Hyun goes to the mart with his wife to buy groceries and asks for sex\\] And countless similar message files pop up along with it. As soon as he sees the file, countless, absurd memories start to pop up in his head... \n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
